                <p>Take your calculations on the go with our mobile app. Available for both iOS and Android devices.</p>
                <ul class="app-features">
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> All calculators in your pocket</li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Works offline without internet</li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Save your calculation history</li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Dark mode for comfortable use</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="app-download">
                    <a href="#" class="download-btn">
                        <i class="fab fa-apple"></i>
                        <span>App Store</span>
                    </a>
